- Only touches tokenization of user-provided write content and output formatting — no protocol/struct changes.
- Preserves delimiter-based sentence splitting (delimiters remain separate tokens).
- Prevents automatic insertion of extra spaces when tokens already contain spaces, so user-specified spacing is preserved verbatim.
- Metadata (sentence/word counts) is still computed from tokens and delimiters, so counts remain consistent.

